languages/sample.ml:1:15: personified-verb: "The triple" is not a person or a program and cannot "say"; make the program or person that acts the subject, or use a verb such as "holds", "marks", "declares" or "determines"
languages/sample.ml:8:22: personified-verb: "The s argument" is not a person or a program and cannot "tell"; make the program or person that acts the subject, or use a verb such as "holds", "marks", "declares" or "determines"
languages/sample.ml:8:39: placeholder-noun: "what it is" is a free relative clause; name the exact term instead, such as "the element type" or "the verb's symbol"
languages/sample.ml:12:23: personified-verb: "the text" is not a person or a program and cannot "say"; make the program or person that acts the subject, or use a verb such as "holds", "marks", "declares" or "determines"
languages/sample.ml:12:28: self-reference: the sentence ends on "says so", which points back instead of stating the fact; state the fact itself
languages/sample.ml:15:67: personified-verb: "the value" is not a person or a program and cannot "decide"; make the program or person that acts the subject, or use a verb such as "holds", "marks", "declares" or "determines"
